</div><details class="stack-more"><summary>More supported tools</summary><p>Salesforce · Pipedrive · Close · Clay</p></details></div>
<section class="metrics"><div><strong>100</strong><p>Free sample leads</p></div><div><strong>10</strong><p>Standard field groups</p></div><div><strong>24<span>h</span></strong><p>Free sample turnaround</p></div><div><strong>$0</strong><p>Seat fees</p></div></section><section class="section paper" id="problem"><div class="problem-layout reveal"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>01</span>START WITH YOUR IDEAL CUSTOMER</p><h2>Start with people who fit your ICP</h2><p>Choose the roles, companies, industries and locations that matter to your campaign. We bring those criteria together in one prospect list, with LinkedIn profiles and business contacts your team can work with.</p></div><div class="target-demo"><div class="segmented" role="group" aria-label="Explore targeting criteria"><button data-target="people" aria-pressed="true">People</button><button data-target="companies" aria-pressed="false">Companies</button></div><div class="target-display"><strong id="target-value">People</strong><p id="target-caption">Decision-makers, relevant roles and LinkedIn profiles</p></div><div class="target-cells" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--i:0"></i><i style="--i:1"></i><i style="--i:2"></i><i style="--i:3"></i><i style="--i:4"></i><i style="--i:5"></i><i style="--i:6"></i><i style="--i:7"></i><i style="--i:8"></i><i style="--i:9"></i><i style="--i:10"></i><i style="--i:11"></i><i style="--i:12"></i><i style="--i:13"></i><i style="--i:14"></i><i style="--i:15"></i><i style="--i:16"></i><i style="--i:17"></i><i style="--i:18"></i><i style="--i:19"></i><i style="--i:20"></i><i style="--i:21"></i><i style="--i:22"></i><i style="--i:23"></i><i style="--i:24"></i><i style="--i:25"></i><i style="--i:26"></i><i style="--i:27"></i><i style="--i:28"></i><i style="--i:29"></i><i style="--i:30"></i><i style="--i:31"></i><i style="--i:32"></i><i style="--i:33"></i><i style="--i:34"></i><i style="--i:35"></i><i style="--i:36"></i><i style="--i:37"></i><i style="--i:38"></i><i style="--i:39"></i><i style="--i:40"></i><i style="--i:41"></i><i style="--i:42"></i><i style="--i:43"></i><i style="--i:44"></i><i style="--i:45"></i><i style="--i:46"></i><i style="--i:47"></i><i style="--i:48"></i><i style="--i:49"></i><i style="--i:50"></i><i style="--i:51"></i><i style="--i:52"></i><i style="--i:53"></i><i style="--i:54"></i><i style="--i:55"></i><i style="--i:56"></i><i style="--i:57"></i><i style="--i:58"></i><i style="--i:59"></i><i style="--i:60"></i><i style="--i:61"></i><i style="--i:62"></i><i style="--i:63"></i><i style="--i:64"></i><i style="--i:65"></i><i style="--i:66"></i><i style="--i:67"></i><i style="--i:68"></i><i style="--i:69"></i><i style="--i:70"></i><i style="--i:71"></i><i style="--i:72"></i><i style="--i:73"></i><i style="--i:74"></i><i style="--i:75"></i><i style="--i:76"></i><i style="--i:77"></i><i style="--i:78"></i><i style="--i:79"></i><i style="--i:80"></i><i style="--i:81"></i><i style="--i:82"></i><i style="--i:83"></i><i style="--i:84"></i><i style="--i:85"></i><i style="--i:86"></i><i style="--i:87"></i><i style="--i:88"></i><i style="--i:89"></i><i style="--i:90"></i><i style="--i:91"></i><i style="--i:92"></i><i style="--i:93"></i><i style="--i:94"></i><i style="--i:95"></i><i style="--i:96"></i><i style="--i:97"></i><i style="--i:98"></i><i style="--i:99"></i></div><p class="diagram-note">Illustrative targeting. Your list follows the criteria you approve.</p><div class="damage"><span>Relevant roles</span><span>LinkedIn profiles</span><span>Company context</span><span>Target markets</span></div></div></div><div class="section-cta"><p>Have a target audience in mind? <strong>See how a sample fits your ICP.</strong></p><div class="cta-pair"><a class="button lime cta-primary" data-sample href="#contact">Get 100 free leads</a><a class="button cta-secondary" href="#pricing">Choose a plan</a></div></div></section><section class="section ink" id="verify"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>02</span>THE CLEAN ROWS DIFFERENCE</p><h2>The right people. The context to connect.</h2><p>A useful prospect list starts with fit. We combine your targeting criteria, LinkedIn profiles, company information and contact checks in one reviewed file.</p></div><div class="verification-layout"><div class="funnel-chart"><div class="funnel-stage reveal" style="--width:100%;--i:0"><div><span class="stage-num">01</span><span>Your campaign brief</span><strong>ICP</strong></div><div class="funnel-track"><i></i></div><small>Roles, sectors, size and geography</small></div><div class="funnel-stage reveal" style="--width:94%;--i:1"><div><span class="stage-num">02</span><span>People &amp; LinkedIn profiles</span><strong>PEOPLE</strong></div><div class="funnel-track"><i></i></div><small>Decision-makers that fit your brief</small></div><div class="funnel-stage reveal" style="--width:88%;--i:2"><div><span class="stage-num">03</span><span>Company &amp; account context</span><strong>CONTEXT</strong></div><div class="funnel-track"><i></i></div><small>Company, domain and industry</small></div><div class="funnel-stage reveal" style="--width:82%;--i:3"><div><span class="stage-num">04</span><span>Business contact checks</span><strong>CONTACT</strong></div><div class="funnel-track"><i></i></div><small>Email verification and available phones</small></div><div class="funnel-stage reveal" style="--width:76%;--i:4"><div><span class="stage-num">05</span><span>Deduplication &amp; formatting</span><strong>CLEAN</strong></div><div class="funnel-track"><i></i></div><small>One consistent, usable file</small></div><div class="funnel-stage reveal" style="--width:70%;--i:5"><div><span class="stage-num">06</span><span>Human review &amp; delivery</span><strong>READY</strong></div><div class="funnel-track"><i></i></div><small>Review the sample, then scale</small></div></div><div class="verification-points"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><div><h3>The right person at the right company</h3><p>We build around your agreed job titles, seniority, company size, industry and location. LinkedIn profiles give your team a direct starting point for research and outreach.</p></div></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><div><h3>Business contacts alongside profile data</h3><p>Verified business emails support email outreach. Publicly available phone numbers add another option where found. Your list is useful across the channels your team chooses.</p></div></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><div><h3>Built fresh for your campaign</h3><p>Your list is built to order against your ICP. Share target accounts, exclusions and campaign requirements up front so the file reflects the audience you want to reach.</p></div></article><article class="reveal"><span>04</span><div><h3>A human reviews the file</h3><p>We review formatting, role and company details, duplicates and obvious mismatches before delivery. You approve the sample before we scale the full list.</p></div></article></div></div><div class="verification-bottom"><p><strong>100 free leads.</strong> Built to your ICP.<br><strong>Review the fit</strong> before your first order.</p><div class="cta-pair"><a class="button lime cta-primary" data-sample href="#contact">Get 100 free leads</a><a class="button cta-secondary" href="#pricing">Choose a plan</a></div></div></section><section class="section paper" id="features"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>03</span>WHAT LANDS IN YOUR FILE</p><h2>Ten field groups. Zero filler columns.</h2><p>Explore the people, profiles, companies and contact details behind each prospect. Use the same file for LinkedIn research, account planning and email outreach. Phone availability varies by prospect.</p></div><div class="field-workspace reveal"><div class="workspace-chrome"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><i aria-hidden="true"></i><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>your-next-campaign.csv</span><small>10 ENRICHED FIELDS</small></div><div class="field-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Enriched lead fields"><button role="tab" id="field-tab-0" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-field="0"><span>01</span>First &amp; last name<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-1" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="1"><span>02</span>Verified business email<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-2" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="2"><span>03</span>Personal LinkedIn profile<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-3" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="3"><span>04</span>Company LinkedIn profile<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-4" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="4"><span>05</span>Mobile number<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-5" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="5"><span>06</span>Company HQ phone<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-6" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="6"><span>07</span>Exact job title<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-7" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="7"><span>08</span>Company &amp; domain<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-8" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="8"><span>09</span>Size &amp; industry<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="field-tab-9" aria-controls="field-detail" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-field="9"><span>10</span>Location<span>↗︎</span></button></div><div class="field-preview"><div class="profile-head"><span class="profile-avatar">MP</span><div><h3>Maya Patel</h3><p>VP of Sales · Northwind</p></div><span class="verified-badge">✓ Verified</span></div><div id="field-detail" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="field-tab-0" tabindex="0"><p class="eyebrow" id="field-name">FIRST &amp; LAST NAME</p><strong id="field-value">Maya Patel</strong><p id="field-description">Cleanly formatted names for personalisation across your outreach.</p></div><div class="profile-footer"><span>✓ LinkedIn profiles</span><span>✓ Business contacts</span><small>Illustrative lead</small></div></div></div><p class="field-standard">Standard fields on every plan. Additional research is scoped before you order.</p><details class="honesty"><summary>What we don’t sell you: tech-stack enrichment <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Other providers advertise tech-stack enrichment. We tested the available sources and weren&#x27;t happy with the accuracy, so we don&#x27;t offer it. We&#x27;d rather leave a column off the sheet than fill it with guesses you&#x27;d build a campaign on. When we can do it properly, we&#x27;ll add it.</p></details><div class="section-cta"><p>Review the fields against your campaign. <strong>Your first 100 leads are free.</strong></p><div class="cta-pair"><a class="button lime cta-primary" data-sample href="#contact">Get 100 free leads</a><a class="button cta-secondary" href="#pricing">Choose a plan</a></div></div></section><How />
<section class="section paper" id="who"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>05</span>BUILT AROUND YOUR OUTBOUND</p><h2>Built for enterprise, SaaS and agency teams</h2><p>From LinkedIn prospecting to account-based campaigns and email outreach, your list follows your audience and your workflow.</p></div><div class="audience-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Your team type"><button role="tab" id="audience-tab-0" aria-controls="audience-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-audience="0">Agencies<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="audience-tab-1" aria-controls="audience-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-audience="1">Enterprise &amp; SaaS<span>↗︎</span></button><button role="tab" id="audience-tab-2" aria-controls="audience-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-audience="2">A niche of your own<span>↗︎</span></button></div><div class="audience-panel reveal" role="tabpanel" id="audience-panel" aria-labelledby="audience-tab-0"><div><span class="audience-index" id="audience-index">01 / AGENCIES</span><h3 id="audience-title">Agencies running multichannel campaigns</h3><p id="audience-body">Build targeted prospect lists for every client, with LinkedIn profiles, company context and business contacts in one file. Separate exports keep client campaigns organised, and per-list pricing keeps costs clear.</p></div><ul id="audience-list"><li>Separate export per client or campaign</li><li>Lower per-lead rates on larger packages</li><li>Priority rebuilds for retainer clients</li><li>White-label friendly files</li></ul></div><div class="section-cta"><p>Find out if your target market fits. <strong>Start with a free sample.</strong></p><div class="cta-pair"><a class="button lime cta-primary" data-sample href="#contact">Get 100 free leads</a><a class="button cta-secondary" href="#pricing">Choose a plan</a></div></div></section>
