<section class="section paper" id="compare"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>07</span>THE HONEST COMPARISON</p><h2>Where we win, and where we don&#x27;t</h2><p>Subscription data platforms are good products with real advantages. If you need a live searchable database your whole team logs into, buy one. If you need clean lists delivered to your ICP, this is more cost effective and cleaner.</p></div><p class="table-hint" id="comparison-scroll-hint">Swipe or scroll sideways to see every column →</p><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Clean Rows and subscription data platforms compared" aria-describedby="comparison-scroll-hint"><table><caption>Clean Rows compared with a typical subscription data platform. Subscription pricing, credits and features vary by provider.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">What matters</th><th scope="col">Clean Rows</th><th scope="col">Typical subscription platform</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Entry price</th><td>$25 / 1,000 leads</td><td>Per-seat plans, often with a free tier; larger plans are often custom-quoted</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Charges per seat</th><td>Never</td><td>Usually</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Commitment</th><td>None, one-time packages</td><td>Monthly or annual subscription</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">How you get data</th><td>Researched fresh to your brief</td><td>Your team searches a shared database with credits</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Self-serve search UI</th><td>No, we build it for you</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First data</th><td>Free 100-lead sample within 24 hours</td><td>Instant export</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="diagram-note">Pricing and contracts vary by provider. Compare against your actual quotes, and see the full comparison of <a href="/compare/b2b-data-subscriptions">Clean Rows and B2B data subscriptions</a>.</p><div class="section-cta"><p>Compare the fit for yourself. <strong>Review 100 leads before your first order.</strong></p><div class="cta-pair"><a class="button lime cta-primary" data-sample href="#contact">Get 100 free leads</a><a class="button cta-secondary" href="#pricing">Choose a plan</a></div></div></section>
